# Collector versions that CI exercises.
#
# This file holds the ONE value that cannot be derived from anything else
# in the repository: the oldest collector release this pipeline is
# claimed to work on.
#
# The *pinned* version is deliberately not here. It already lives in
# docker-compose.yml, chart/values.yaml and chart/Chart.yaml, and CI
# reads it from docker-compose.yml and asserts the other two agree —
# see the `pins` job in .github/workflows/ci.yml. Copying it into a
# fourth file would add a fourth thing to drift.
#
# Raise COLLECTOR_MIN_SUPPORTED only when the configuration actually
# requires something a newer release introduced, and record why in
# docs/versions.md. Raising it because a newer release exists costs
# users a forced upgrade and buys nothing.
COLLECTOR_MIN_SUPPORTED=0.157.0
